        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' forceUpdate='true' h='34647' hidden='true' id='6' story-point-id='1' type-v2='text' w='32087' x='48228' y='21162'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>Geographic Distribution of Customers and Claims</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>This map shows where our insurance customers are located across different states.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>It helps us quickly spot which regions have the highest customer volume and claim activity, setting the stage for our regional analysis.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' h='32884' hidden='true' id='7' story-point-id='2' type-v2='text' w='33268' x='60335' y='14627'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Income vs. Customer Lifetime Value</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>This chart explores the relationship between a customer&apos;s income and their overall lifetime value.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>The trend line helps us see if higher income levels reliably result in a higher customer lifetime value, or if the relationship is more scattered.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' h='24066' hidden='true' id='8' story-point-id='3' type-v2='text' w='33268' x='44291' y='40560'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>Claim Amounts by Vehicle Size</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>This chart compares the distribution of total claim amounts across small, medium, and large vehicles.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>It highlights differences in median claim values and helps us easily identify extreme high-claim outliers for each vehicle size category.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' forceUpdate='true' h='30705' id='9' story-point-id='4' type-v2='text' w='31299' x='30020' y='25934'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'>Interactive Regional Explorer</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'>This final dashboard brings our entire analysis together into an interactive view.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'>Stakeholders can click on any state on the map to dynamically filter both the regression plot and the boxplot, uncovering how customer value and claim distributions shift by region.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
      </zones>
      <simple-id uuid='{F35E2156-A999-484B-A723-B9B5994B0E37}' />
